# Next.js (Aga Pay site)

- Marketing copy lives in `lib/content.ts`; avoid scattering strings in components.
- App Router under `app/`; use existing section components in `components/sections/`.
- Styling: Tailwind v4 patterns already in repo.
- No server secrets in client components; use env only when needed and document in `*.example`.